id: pm-zsic8h
title: Canonicalize unknown-command recovery with replacement flags
description: "GitHub source https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1252. GitHub reports that guessed pm start suggests deprecated start-task before the supported claim --start composition. Historical synonym ranking and lifecycle composition are shipped; candidate replacement awareness remains the distinct reported gap."
