author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: Unknown-command guidance leads directly to the canonical replacement and never offers a deprecated candidate without it; start resolves or suggests claim --start; unrelated weak matches do not displace actionable recovery.
goal: project management = context management
objective: Resolve deprecated unknown-command suggestions to canonical replacements
value: Lower agent recovery cost and preserve safe customizable SDK composition
parent: pm-mpbb
resolution: "Canonical recovery preserves replacement flags and prefers available semantic matches over unrelated guesses, retaining fallback when needed."
expected_result: "Canonical recovery preserves replacement flags and prefers available semantic matches over unrelated guesses, retaining fallback when needed."
actual_result: "All 8809 tests and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage pass, together with relevant static, type, SDK, recovery, token, packed npm/Bun, and manual package acceptance. See PR #1254 for the immutable hosted-review and merge evidence."
