  "2026-09-13T09:21:03.366Z","harness:codex","TDD and acceptance evidence: the initial regression run failed the expected new assertions before implementation. Connected focused suite now passes 144 tests. A temporary initialized workspace installed the published pm-ops package and executed ops metrics beside core ops health; three-item default list is six lines and start guidance retains claim --start. Full coverage and hosted validation remain pending. Live Sentry 14-day threshold read is accessible with zero blocking issues; required telemetry gate passes with 2.21 percent finish error rate and no missing error-code rows. This aggregate gate is not per-action correlation proof."
  "2026-09-13T09:45:59.824Z","harness:codex","Final source verification: all 683 test files and 8808 tests passed. Exact all-source coverage is 100/100/100/100: statements 64355/64355, branches 49089/49089, functions 13372/13372, lines 61640/61640. No thresholds or exclusions were weakened. Static code, documentation, duplicate, contract, SDK surface, and performance checks passed; the initial graph prose-reference failure was corrected with typed relationships, then graph and record-integrity assurance passed. Packed consumer and hosted review evidence remain pending."
  "2026-09-13T09:49:48.675Z","harness:codex","Final local acceptance passed: context evaluation and 57 token surfaces; npx/bunx packed package smoke; separate npm and Bun tarball consumers exercising SDK canonicalization, initialization, mutations, six-line TOON, and full JSON; package-first authoring dogfood; compatibility migration with health and validation true. Reviewed delivery closure captures implementation and local verification; GitHub checks, bot review, merge, and publication are separate pending claims."
  "2026-09-13T10:10:30.417Z","harness:codex","Sourcery guide on PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1254 identified weak unrelated statistics suggestions beside the correct start recovery. Strengthened the existing regression; it failed before implementation because stats remained. The SDK canonicalization primitive now optionally accepts the query token and prefers available semantic candidates after replacement availability checks, retaining fuzzy fallback if a semantic target is unavailable."
  "2026-09-13T10:11:56.205Z","harness:codex","The strengthened existing regression and broader CLI error suite now pass (147 tests). SDK snapshot signature governance required an explicit rationale for adding the optional query token: the helper is introduced only in this unmerged PR, existing two-argument calls remain compatible, and no published SDK signature changes. Full final coverage is rerunning."
  "2026-09-13T10:29:55.868Z","harness:codex","Corrected delivery verification: 683 files and 8809 tests pass with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage (64360 statements, 49095 branches, 13372 functions, 61645 lines; zero uncovered). Static quality, type checks, SDK snapshot, docs links, refusal and agent-task token gates, npx/bunx smoke, independent npm/Bun packed SDK consumers, and published pm-ops manual acceptance all pass. First-head GitHub checks and hosted analyzers passed; all available first-round reports were acknowledged. Live review and merge evidence is maintained on https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1254."
